		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Quasi-divine, massive albino serpent set as guardian of holy shrine and sites. Often served by local tribes.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 58, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 bite +10 (4d8 + poison), <strong>MV</strong> near (burrow, fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 11</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Fascinate</strong>. All mortals within double near, CHA 18+ or fascinated for 1d4 rounds. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 18+ or 1d8 CON and DEX damage and age 1d100 years. Old age kills.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
